  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that multimodal models with scvi_n200 and resnet50 have similar performance (0.536-0.539 accuracy). This experiment tests replacing resnet50 with imagenet_vit_l (a more advanced image encoder) while keeping RNA encoder, profile setting, and fusion method consistent. This clarifies the impact of image encoder choice, a critical design decision, without over-interpreting minor differences. It balances exploration of key components (image encoder) with consistency in other parameters."
